e, Jun mindlessly does so only to find that his order instantly disappears from his drawer. A package suddenly appears, containing a beautiful antique doll. When wound up, this doll comes to life. Sadly for Jun, this doll Shinku views Jun as an equivalent for a servant. Despite the constant demands Jun now receives from Shinku, she slowly helps him overcome his fears of human contact as well as protect him from the deadly battles that come into his life due to her appearance."},"tags":[{"name":"Seinen","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ojou-sama","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":84,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Hikikomori","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Anthropomorphism","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Battle Royale","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rehabilitation","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":65,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":56,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":30,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":26,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Cute Girls Doing Cute Things","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Rozen Maiden","english":"Rozen Maiden","native":"ローゼンメイデン","romaji":"Rozen Maiden","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"蔷薇少女"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"蔷薇少女 第一季"}]},"trailer":{"id":"EtBxEYU1GFQ","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EtBxEYU1GFQ/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}